Dear Sermsawat,

NAs are not permitted in design matrices in edgeR.  If you have NAs, you 
have to remove these libraries explicitly:

   i <- !is.na(Growth64)
   disph64 <- estimateGLMCommonDisp(d[,i], design[i,])

