We have not  included Omegahat as long as anyone here can remember.
We do point to our own extra repository which includes some Omegahat
packages, but  Rcompression has never been in that repository, at
least since BioC 1.8.

Some Omegahat packages, such as XML, are available in CRAN, which
could account for this, but it doesn't look like Rcompression is one
of them.

Dan



